msgid "At a height that the camera can have a good view of the tags, switch to Alt-Hold to adjust level position. Observe the feedback on RViz as well as Mission Planner to see if tags are detected."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:173
#: e63df30c6ea84917a0b3cb98ef02a5ca
